{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Trials is a tile-placing puzzle game where layouts become more complex and your tiles improve as you progress. Earn bonus points by satisfying layout constraints and pick up powerful new tiles from the market to push past the score threshold!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/e720b1723248b08b103685b364253e7f.poster.avif?t=1771808404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/e720b1723248b08b103685b364253e7f.webm?t=1771808404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/e720b1723248b08b103685b364253e7f.mp4?t=1771808404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of Level Layouts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hundreds of unique layouts, designed to steadily introduce new mechanics, score challenges, and strategic opportunities. Every level is a stepping stone to mastery, rewarding your growing skills with increasingly satisfying solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/595f504c7a646a87777c3af815370c28.webp?t=1771808404\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/595f504c7a646a87777c3af815370c28.poster.avif?t=1771808404\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six Unique Challenge Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way you play with special challenge trials that introduce new rules and mechanics. From timed challenges to golf style scoring, these trials offer a fresh twist on the core gameplay and push you to think in new ways. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thirty Hand-crafted Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are hand-crafted levels with a specific set of constraints and available tiles. Ranging from easy, deduction based solutions to hard, Sudoku-like challenges that will test your skills in achieving the maximum possible score under the harshest conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2901380?t=1771808404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/e1d0fd3be1b72db7c5958a09f3a715fe0c537504/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771808404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/e611d644cbac0146e4214b62ab3510b6a35de6ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771808404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/e611d644cbac0146e4214b62ab3510b6a35de6ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771808404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4174920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Trials is a tile-placing puzzle game where layouts become more complex and your tiles improve as you progress. Earn bonus points by satisfying layout constraints and pick up powerful new tiles from the market to push past the score threshold!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901380/extras/e720b1723248b08b103685b364253e7f.